# MCP server config. Ignored because the Postgres server takes its connection
# string as a command-line argument, so the file holds a database password in
# plaintext. Committing it would put that password in the repository's history,
# where removing it later means a rewrite. Copy .mcp.json.example instead.
.mcp.json
